cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Zero-point focusing makes the null-cone clock of arXiv:2611.34924 infinite"
abstract: >-
  The causal-diamond clock of arXiv:2611.34924 is a product of shear operators.
  Zero-point fluctuations of the null-cone modes make it infinite on every
  state in the paper's own state-counting setting, so the causal-diamond space
  is {0}, and both of the paper's arguments that states exist fail.
